o the returned URL, then use ",[500,804,50],{"href":197}," to confirm the subscription and grant access. The return page alone is not proof of payment.",[492,807,809],{"id":808},"choose-your-layer","Choose your layer",[811,812,813,826],"table",{},[814,815,816],"thead",{},[817,818,819,823],"tr",{},[820,821,822],"th",{},"You need",[820,824,825],{},"Use",[827,828,829,844,852],"tbody",{},[817,830,831,835],{},[832,833,834],"td",{},"Billing in a Laravel app",[832,836,837,843],{},[500,838,842],{"href":839,"rel":840},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fvatly\u002Fvatly-laravel",[841],"nofollow","vatly-laravel",". It wires Fluent into Laravel for you.",[817,845,846,849],{},[832,847,848],{},"Fluent billing flows in plain PHP, Symfony, WordPress, or a custom driver",[832,850,851],{},"This package. Start without storage; add repositories when you need local records.",[817,853,854,857],{},[832,855,856],{},"A few direct API calls, without local billing state",[832,858,859,864],{},[500,860,863],{"href":861,"rel":862},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fpackages\u002Fphp\u002Freadme",[841],"vatly-api-php",". No Fluent layer required.",[471,866,867,868,871,872,871,875,878,879,882],{},"With the raw SDK you assemble checkout payloads and coordinate webhook persistence yourself. Fluent gives those common tasks names: ",[487,869,870],{},"toPlan()",", ",[487,873,874],{},"swapAndInvoice()",[487,876,877],{},"updateBilling()",", and ",[487,880,881],{},"webhookProcessor()->handle()",". It does not supply tables, routes, authorization, transactions, or exactly-once delivery.",[492,884,9],{"id":885},"guides",[811,887,888,898],{},[814,889,890],{},[817,891,892,895],{},[820,893,894],{},"Task",[820,896,897],{},"Page",[827,899,900,909,918,927,936,945,954,963,973,982,991],{},[817,901,902,905],{},[832,903,904],{},"Install, set keys, redirects, and handle errors",[832,906,907],{},[500,908,173],{"href":174},[817,910,911,914],{},[832,912,913],{},"Connect billables and storage",[832,915,916],{},[500,91